[00:00.57]1. Gracious Jehovah, we praise you and thank you.
[00:08.35]Father, we make these expressions in prayer.
[00:17.95]Trusting in you, we will serve you completely,
[00:23.76]Knowing we thrive under your tender care.
[00:29.57]Daily our errors reveal imperfection.
[00:38.68]For our transgressions forgiveness we seek.
[00:52.70]Thankful we are that our lives have been ransomed.
[00:59.70]Thankful we are that you know we are weak.
[01:09.70]2. Grateful we are that you show love and kindness.
[01:17.37]Thank you for drawing us closer to you.
[01:25.37]Teach us to know you, and help us to serve you.
[01:33.37]Show us the way to be loyal and true.
[01:42.52]Thankful we are for your powerful spirit.
[01:49.52]Grateful we are for the courage to speak.
[01:59.52]May we be humble and happy to serve you;
[02:08.06]May we give thanks, for you favor the meek.